    <string name="about_info_txt">Created by Emily Granville

        \n\nTo create a new video game item upon starting the app, please click the menu button at
        the bottom and select the option to add a game.

        \n\nPlease be aware that because you have the option to save either to the cloud or to your
        personal device, adding, deleting, or editing games does not automatically save. You
        must save manually either to your device or to the cloud each time if you wish to save
        that information.

        \n\nOn loading, the app automatically loads the data saved to the device. To see the
        information saved to the cloud, please select that button from the menu.</string>
